# Krosan Grip: split second (CR 702.61a) - as long as it is on the stack, players can't cast spells or activate abilities that
# aren't mana abilities, but they still get priority (the ruling) and may activate mana abilities (CR 702.61b). Bot1 casts Grip
# at Bot2's Sol Ring. With it on the stack Bot2 can't activate Mother of Runes nor cast Lightning Bolt (the refusals), but taps
# Llanowar Elves for {G}. Grip destroys the Sol Ring (CR 701.8); once it has left the stack Bot2 may act again (the ruling): it
# activates Mother and bolts Bot1 (the positive controls), in the same main phase.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Krosan Grip
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Sol Ring
Mother of Runes
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

